ributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":8,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"117f1c34026eaa05f62b8be780376a602dce4a82","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add assertions for task invariants","messageBody":"Task construction, command parsing, and persistence rely on several\nnon-null values and collection invariants that were previously implicit.\n\nAdd assertions at these internal boundaries and keep the task list\u0027s\ncapacity invariant explicit. Enable assertions for Gradle\u0027s run task so\nthese assumptions are checked during local execution.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0},"java":{"insertions":30,"deletions":13}}},{"hash":"2d8f353b8f316e73b9f664f48dd9933049e5d594","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Improve parser readability and task lookup","messageBody":"The parser used unexplained numeric offsets and repeated marker\nliterals, while task lookup errors were duplicated in multiple service\nmethods.\n\nReplace parser magic values with named constants, centralize task lookup\nerrors in a helper, and correct the parser\u0027s Javadoc formatting. This\nmakes the command-processing flow easier to read and reduces duplicated\nlogic without changing behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":40,"deletions":21}}},{"hash":"4d80a6791f0a4749289fe5def9fa96d24ca02a9d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use streams for collection transformations","messageBody":"Task searching, task serialization, and task-list formatting all process\ncollections using manual loops, which obscures the transformations.\n\nUse streams to filter matching tasks, map tasks to saved records, and\nformat numbered task output. Keep file loading as a loop because it\nneeds ordered error handling and early termination.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":14,"deletions":22}}},{"hash":"eec5215dd9010dfc8e415761c5bfd7e841b3dca6","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from zwqqwz123/branch-A-Assertions",